cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use bench-template in your work, please cite it as below."
title: "bench-template: a starting point for a critical code studies research bench"
abstract: >-
  A starting point for a critical code studies research bench: a static site for
  reading, comparing and annotating the versions of a program's source code with a
  group. Built on bench-kit, the modules shared by the SHRDLU and Spacewar! benches.
type: software
authors:
